# Geo-services (BRouter routing + Photon geocoding on the VPS)
#
# Local dev: run an SSH tunnel and leave these unset (defaults hit localhost):
#   ssh -N -L 17777:127.0.0.1:17777 -L 2322:127.0.0.1:2322 root@YOUR_VPS_HOST
#
# Production (Vercel): after running deploy/vps-geo-gateway.sh on the VPS:
# GEO_ROUTE_BASE=https://YOUR_GATEWAY_HOST/geo/route
# GEO_SEARCH_BASE=https://YOUR_GATEWAY_HOST/geo/search
# GEO_KEY=<contents of /root/.geo-key on the VPS>
